1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,546
The last idea in respiration: the respiratory quotient, R Q.

2
00:00:05,546 --> 00:00:12,656
It is the volume of carbon dioxide given out, divided by the volume of oxygen taken in, in the same time.

3
00:00:12,656 --> 00:00:18,085
It tells you what the cell is burning, and it is measured with Ganong's respirometer.

